{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>梁詠琪（Gigi）即將在香港體育館（紅館）舉辦全新個人演唱會，消息一出讓歌迷期待不已。曾與她合作經典愛情電影《初戀無限Touch》的男星陳曉東，近日驚喜在社群平台上曬出兩人合照，隔空為好友的全新專輯與紅館演出加油打氣。</p><p>這場跨越30年的世紀同框曝光後，立刻勾起無數粉絲的青春記憶。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳曉東曬出與梁詠琪合影，兩人對鏡頭展現燦爛笑容，神韻與輪廓依舊神似當年。（threads@danielchanreal）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187428566225391616158762.jpeg/EhjAs3DQoqjfH0TKbwpouEGJ5Glv8oyUMh2RaTIdkWk\"/><figcaption>陳曉東曬出與梁詠琪合影，兩人對鏡頭展現燦爛笑容，神韻與輪廓依舊神似當年。（threads@danielchanreal）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳曉東曬出與梁詠琪合影，兩人對鏡頭展現燦爛笑容，神韻與輪廓依舊神似當年。（threads@danielchanreal）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187428563054366720261085.jpeg/kaa9qBa4ftGgm5oXYi3biyXXEhHQzJIpjPULGoz1Cxo\"/><figcaption>陳曉東曬出與梁詠琪合影，兩人對鏡頭展現燦爛笑容，神韻與輪廓依舊神似當年。（threads@danielchanreal）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳曉東曬出與梁詠琪合影，兩人對鏡頭展現燦爛笑容，神韻與輪廓依舊神似當年。（threads@danielchanreal）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187428559518437376605283.jpeg/lNBA5NonhsIOPA_MINeEBqTOM_6zJihDwbCFgMGwhYA\"/><figcaption>陳曉東曬出與梁詠琪合影，兩人對鏡頭展現燦爛笑容，神韻與輪廓依舊神似當年。（threads@danielchanreal）</figcaption></figure><p>更多梁詠琪與陳曉東相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1518946/org/45ad6c65e47026612b31cd946c102755.jpg/RfUHlu5KRAnprEY_AIIx3ZmI5QoqSJfWmrJCJJqyQiQ\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大家對當年《初戀無限Touch》入面嘅阿康同阿塔仲有冇印象呢？呢個Look真係令人充滿回憶。（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/999835/org/2a46dc05916ce73ee00b8196e1f0707a.jpg/L5Ufaj2rg9E39S0BM4y0VWTD910sFOR-_Qi_Xv0Iv14\"/><figcaption>大家對當年《初戀無限Touch》入面嘅阿康同阿塔仲有冇印象呢？呢個Look真係令人充滿回憶。（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187433583871266816218453.jpeg/_hQ52vIzLMEGnuTRggQ1Xs0uL9lPSpgaIHY2_SB2Nv0\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187433544935280640217583.jpeg/cEEmefYLkKSLiA0W9Jgvp_eczRU2Tgu5zigAWs4oAFo\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187433579605397504389540.jpeg/hY7Odck0lhjghetOMLrwpmrDLxkHphhJng2xQ54NsUM\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187433588225216512867351.jpeg/Y5jiPbqOAZqH9qc7iF1JFiPvpO-Emrl0fVlAyn1ZQMo\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187433549415059456619723.jpeg/Wh-PqgYZtqx9L-2RoJeo0J7x_DFBz9mWEW7X8BFu1_A\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187433581790760960028594.jpeg/GAKRZEHrtrvl9nmRrvIoLi0KhVrlSymuKLCBViiwgVY\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187433586169876480864932.jpeg/RrArJtlE5hIKbfjqujJLFA0b8VtBwpYzPPGCnjzxgp4\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187433547246473216758649.jpeg/B7Qbaso9aT5IQkjRaDIoirrOkBpgymC7Yqkwc2KpMHM\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪與陳曉東（《初戀無限TOUCH》電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳曉東和梁詠琪在愛民邨的走廊踩單車，陳在劇中說：「我阿爸說這裏風水好，不會搬。」（《初戀無限Touch》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/359684/org/8f9d6bbecd09b816fa688f78bfd18852.jpg/dloSiAU4_ktnsJki8-xTIkdpcgAObxN__y4R6P8uEeg\"/><figcaption>陳曉東和梁詠琪在愛民邨的走廊踩單車，陳在劇中說：「我阿爸說這裏風水好，不會搬。」（《初戀無限Touch》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪（IG@gigileungwingkei）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260919/1177999878450581504584932.jpeg/QCQVdIyD7buC44szXT9Kh6RJK8a2f5iP0hxImdIcSJk\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪（IG@gigileungwingkei）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳曉東（FB@陳曉東）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240829/905800792693542912403759.jpeg/LBLPelj7BSiHnnGYcToPAU_tpZjffAySHFB0nhxQdJ4\"/><figcaption>陳曉東（FB@陳曉東）</figcaption></figure><p>陳曉東在貼文中感性寫下：</p><blockquote><p>多久沒真正聚了。30年的友誼，也是一種溫柔的存在。</p></blockquote><p>並預祝梁詠琪接下來的演藝計畫大獲全勝。照片中兩人對鏡頭展現燦爛笑容，神韻與輪廓依舊神似當年。</p><p>雖然陳曉東身穿過去巡演的連帽衫，讓外界猜測這張合照或許是珍貴的舊照重溫，但粉絲們對此毫不介意，紛紛湧入留言區直呼：</p><p>「青春回來了」</p><p>「兩人根本完全沒變」</p><p>「凍齡神顏太強大」</p><p>還有網友笑說這是：</p><p>「龍鳳胎再聚」</p><p>「從小一直以為你們是雙胞胎兄妹」</p><p>回顧兩人過去的演藝軌跡，梁詠琪與陳曉東在90年代紅極一時，不僅被外界封為歌壇金童玉女，更因五官輪廓與高挑身型相仿，常被粉絲笑稱是演藝圈的「龍鳳胎」。梁詠琪過去受訪時也曾笑談，因為兩人外型太像，甚至還開玩笑猜想過彼此的孩子未來會不會也有幾分神似。事隔多年，兩人各自在家庭與事業上都有很好的發展，這次的驚喜互動不僅展現了演藝圈難得的持久好交情，也再度掀起一波90年代的懷舊熱潮。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：梁詠琪機場被捕獲50歲純素顏曝光嚇呆網民　一舉動令人意想不到（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241026/926922612708478976172053.jpeg/Nwm37Bj9Kmo19laYdv4mTLffiYK28wKjyB7Ja_IeyWs\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：梁詠琪機場被捕獲50歲純素顏曝光嚇呆網民　一舉動令人意想不到（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪 (Gigi) 初出道時憑一把清爽短髮以及清純外貌，俘虜了萬千少男的心。（《短髮》MV截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956216094324953088763150.jpeg/rRP9AzbSxeFKMUM1ZriJqSzC2pmCB7GEFNvAABTbwAA\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪 (Gigi) 初出道時憑一把清爽短髮以及清純外貌，俘虜了萬千少男的心。（《短髮》MV截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪一家三口幸福美滿。(IG圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240328/850033816591667200293718.jpeg/1D7Hexp7NHUpMB8SwSIz4Tf3yHtRcRmCksZBupLGQbo\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪一家三口幸福美滿。(IG圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪月前慶祝50歲生日快樂！（IG@gigileungwingkei）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126523602540171264473890.jpeg/kKuFcN7vPyMWlKnL04xHyZu7TIXledsmH2m-XB9pvlw\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪月前慶祝50歲生日快樂！（IG@gigileungwingkei）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪早前參與電影《逆轉上半場》。（《逆轉上半場》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126525280890916864306519.jpeg/tBZ4Qk9kffgZ1filkpqQWo8T_NmzATJy-SfTqPkn06g\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪早前參與電影《逆轉上半場》。（《逆轉上半場》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪主演劇集《聰明鎮》今年出街。（IG@gigileungwingkei）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126529782960361472975218.jpeg/p_HfaQbYNEnC-qJkmoObJSkGznUtO9TtzRqeec0annk\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪主演劇集《聰明鎮》今年出街。（IG@gigileungwingkei）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪將演出全國語對白的舞台劇《我們成為的她》。（舞台劇《我們成為的她》海報）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126524657130803200954716.jpeg/MBTHgcmd61ZBcyFbr6QR1fGaSrOO12cCpvMAmKbzAJg\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪將演出全國語對白的舞台劇《我們成為的她》。（舞台劇《我們成為的她》海報）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪一家三口在韓國被捕獲。（小紅書@ayuyou）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126525915371671552621970.jpeg/a2VfSktAQWW6Z7qTHVdzQr2VS7jZqDf1VuynRlbsp0Y\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪一家三口在韓國被捕獲。（小紅書@ayuyou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博主透露當日梁詠琪「純素顏」。（小紅書@ayuyou）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126526897577005056518620.png/dBOE5qSQ25E5cNhQm6DL0wDw-nNTSnrBP4srVT-LK1U\"/><figcaption>博主透露當日梁詠琪「純素顏」。（小紅書@ayuyou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民留言。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126527935830822912091852.png/yXNmmlqy78BS8p_G4ieJ_mDcIzwWqi4VaPf1q2j39as\"/><figcaption>網民留言。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民留言。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126527938007797760482936.png/GgX95jGTDkFUSKAg9FblJhS9wvSAHzKanuq19Z7qtfU\"/><figcaption>網民留言。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民留言。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126527940155412480721936.png/w_0rXbS3yDLVxlMbX3_04t3AaQwDDb7wkXaHKZF2hyk\"/><figcaption>網民留言。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民留言。（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126527942340775936850361.png/i_OaZ1OWaEQLRxnXSXTqdPJv0yAThgc_Z79Y9We_WPU\"/><figcaption>網民留言。（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪近年亦再度活躍幕前。（IG@gigileungwingkei）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956218379218194432937581.jpeg/XxBH5He2A8LKV6mnkWSdc4bEDqnzfzAnoUyabaFMmm0\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪近年亦再度活躍幕前。（IG@gigileungwingkei）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"重拾歌手身分開演唱會。（IG@gigileungwingkei）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956218923626270720075219.jpeg/enFvV5X7Gd82ppiVMaca_fLEkCYXYbKGl_iBPZf4gT0\"/><figcaption>重拾歌手身分開演唱會。（IG@gigileungwingkei）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態極佳。（IG@gigileungwingkei）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126529284245032960290534.jpeg/idoOyCXjn9uXKrFyLgmMVw0A6PjDA2p8HL8XoBy_F6A\"/><figcaption>狀態極佳。（IG@gigileungwingkei）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"無懼素顏示人。（IG@gigileungwingkei）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956219431350964224321687.jpeg/GeijVuzhVmlbmwog4wZHTmSY6lKpSK_dBnKvVAZyr1Q\"/><figcaption>無懼素顏示人。（IG@gigileungwingkei）</figcaption></figure><p>劉德華暌違6年登香港紅館　梁詠琪、陳慧琳台下示愛</p><p>古天樂單身快樂！被逼催生妙回：不是異形難無性生殖</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:53.268589+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1669,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T01:00:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T03:57:48.290059+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:37.695753+00:00","content_hash":"2a25f3721466eb3a681ea7d0ac88bf6db994b1c99ded9d2d6083aa150c086548","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}